                    },
                    "message": "I would expect at least one assert per key in propMapStub, to make sure it got translated like we expect."
                },
                {
                    "file": "test/redfish-core/include/dbus_log_watcher_test.cpp",
                    "line": 50,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
